{"2926700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Presidential Rise", "steam_appid": 2926700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/84b51bd572d2b60d8cde17a9c60f31db.avif?t=1769043607\" width=780 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Presidential Rise</strong> is a political strategy and management sim where you lead a rising nation as its newly elected president. Balance economic growth, public satisfaction, and political stability while facing mounting pressure from a powerful billionaire antagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make high-stakes decisions, respond to shifting citizen demands, and navigate a web of policies, crises, and conflicting interests. Every choice you make shapes your nation—and your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/04cd7381913b9a68c65e22176af047dc.poster.avif?t=1769043607\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/04cd7381913b9a68c65e22176af047dc.webm?t=1769043607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/04cd7381913b9a68c65e22176af047dc.mp4?t=1769043607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you lead with integrity, or give in to the forces pulling the strings?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/d04cb86e18d27baad06f564af5c1ffe4.avif?t=1769043607\" width=780 height=85 /></span> 🗳️ <strong>Dynamic Decision-Making</strong> – Enact policies, give interviews, and steer national direction through tough moral and political choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/0898116002ecafdf22468bf3749a0de4.poster.avif?t=1769043607\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/0898116002ecafdf22468bf3749a0de4.webm?t=1769043607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/0898116002ecafdf22468bf3749a0de4.mp4?t=1769043607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>🏗️ <strong>Evolving Requests &amp; Infrastructure</strong> – Expand infrastructure and address the changing needs of your people across each playthrough.<br><br>📊 <strong>Popularity &amp; Power Balance</strong> – Keep different community groups satisfied—or risk losing control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/bd5641c468e4c71ec109836fb310f7df.poster.avif?t=1769043607\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/bd5641c468e4c71ec109836fb310f7df.webm?t=1769043607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/bd5641c468e4c71ec109836fb310f7df.mp4?t=1769043607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>💰 <strong>Economic &amp; Export Systems</strong> – Manage trade, resources, and financial health under constant pressure.<br><br>⚖️ <strong>Crisis &amp; Corruption Management</strong> – Investigate scandals, handle emergencies, and protect your administration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/eddb4ceb27af0c5110e76e3298fa7237.poster.avif?t=1769043607\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/eddb4ceb27af0c5110e76e3298fa7237.webm?t=1769043607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/eddb4ceb27af0c5110e76e3298fa7237.mp4?t=1769043607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>🎭 <strong>Political Dilemmas &amp; Opposition</strong> – Face a powerful rival and make tough political decisions where your leadership ideals are constantly challenged through media confrontations and public expectations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>Take the oath. Stand your ground. <strong>The future of your nation begins with you.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/84b51bd572d2b60d8cde17a9c60f31db.avif?t=1769043607\" width=780 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Presidential Rise</strong> is a political strategy and management sim where you lead a rising nation as its newly elected president. Balance economic growth, public satisfaction, and political stability while facing mounting pressure from a powerful billionaire antagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make high-stakes decisions, respond to shifting citizen demands, and navigate a web of policies, crises, and conflicting interests. Every choice you make shapes your nation—and your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/04cd7381913b9a68c65e22176af047d